{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34014","headline":"送润卿博士还华阳 · 皮日休","name":"送润卿博士还华阳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪打篷舟离酒旗，华阳居士半酣归。\n逍遥只恐逢云将，恬澹真应降月妃。\n仙市鹿胎如锦嫩，阴宫燕肉似酥肥。\n公车草合蒲轮坏，争不教他白日飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}